  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=14822e&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_overview.webp\" alt=\"概述\"></p>\n<p>本模组支持 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也可仅安装于服务端。Forge 支持已在 1.20.4 版本后移除。</p>\n<h3>关于</h3>\n<p>Moogs Soaring Structures 通过添加大量带有酷炫建筑等可供探索内容的浮空岛，为你的我的世界世界注入生机、乐趣与多样性！探索由原版方块和实体打造的精彩新结构，并在途中发现战利品、敌对生物和村民。本模组兼容任何整合包，甚至可仅安装于服务端！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以3D实时浏览所有结构\"></a></p>\n<p>若要查看部分结构，请访问我们的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">预览网站</a></p>\n<h3>配置包</h3>\n<p>模组的各个方面均可使用数据包进行自定义。带有完整说明的模板可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mss-moogs-soaring-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>找到</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_features.webp\" alt=\"特性\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040210/description_84b68622-1f45-4dd0-b110-ff18e67252ac.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p>\n<h3>视频</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uiA_VsbAYgo?si=ytBXGNcAblSRa62-&start=409\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uWsSgXHbGwo?si=LIWDsyhLydDAFH5b&start=567\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DL5nGIa6K2Y?si=1_N6a2DM50MrtfJW\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包请点<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d61020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_discord.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p>获得回复的最佳且最快的方式是加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_promo.webp\" alt=\"赞助\"></a></p>",
